abstract: >-
  Unrefereed manuscripts and exact verification artifacts for a four-terminal
  planar lower bound in cost-preserving single-source unsplittable-flow
  rounding and an exact non-attained 17/8 supremum for the same fixed gadget
  under two simultaneous scenario-wise cost-nonincrease constraints.
